ACTIVATION & KEYS
=================
The HMAC signing key used by the offline activation system is intentionally
NOT included in this repository (only a placeholder constant is present).
Any keys found elsewhere are confidential property of the copyright holder
and may not be used to generate activation codes without authorization.

